sequenceDiagram
    participant Video as 📹 VideoFrames
    participant Engine as 🤖 PoseEngine(ML Kit)
    participant Adapter as 🔄 KeypointAdapter
    participant Pipeline as 🧮 OfflinePipeline
    participant Export as 📤 Exporter

    Video->>Engine: 逐帧输入(720p@30fps, stride=2)
    Engine-->>Adapter: 输出33点原生关键点
    Adapter-->>Pipeline: 转换为中立语义(归一化x/y,score,z)
    Pipeline-->>Export: 输出neutral_keypoints.json
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: 滤波→角度计算→相位分段→计数→评分
    Pipeline-->>Export: 输出angles.csv 与 result.json
    Export-->>Logs: 记录run.log 与 perf.json
